 * cs [0x544d,0x5615) / file [0x564d,0x5815), 456 bytes.
 *
 * Prints the name of a keyboard scan code (bit 7 masked) at the text cursor:
 * named keys (ESC, BKSP, TAB, CTRL, ... NUMLK), F1-F10 as 'F' + itoa(n),
